### 차량 등록
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/vehicles
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "externalId": "VEHICLE-002",
    "modelName": "IONIQ 6",
    "name": "Test Vehicle"
}

### 중복 차량 등록 테스트
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/vehicles
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "externalId": "VEHICLE-001",
  "modelName": "IONIQ 5",
  "name": "Test Vehicle (duplicate)"
}

### 차량 단건 조회
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/vehicles/1

### 차량 목록 조회
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/vehicles

### 차량 목록 조회 -- paging
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/vehicles?page=0&size=10&sort=id,desc

### 존재하지 않는 차량 조회
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/vehicles/9999999

### 필수값 누락
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/vehicles
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "externalId": "",
  "modelName": "IONIQ 5",
  "name": "Test Vehicle (not valid)"
}